      ρ b) _ (by simp [*])).trans (by simp [key (hρ _), add_div]), Quot.ind fun a b ↦ by
      simpa [key (hρ _), ← mul_div] using! @key (a • ρ b) _ (by simp [*]; rfl)⟩
