New.RealPlace.LocalTheorem).

This file: Three weight integrals and sliced Plancherel bounds on quadrics and Heisenberg
radicals. -/

open ENNReal FI Fintype Level Matrix MeasureTheory Place ProbabilityTheory Set Size U

